@startuml
!include style.puml

title Linking, refined

state Linking {
  [*]         --> Scanning
  Scanning    --> Connecting  : ScanMatch /\nlogical device id
  Connecting  --> Bonding     : Connected
  Bonding     --> Discovering : Bonded
  Discovering --> Configuring : ServicesDiscovered
  Configuring --> Subscribed  : MtuSettled and\nCccdConfirmed
  Discovering --> Scanning    : ServiceChanged /\nrediscover
  Subscribed  --> [*]
}

Linking --> Authenticating : begin session

note right of Linking
  Every substate has a timeout.
  Expiry leaves Linking for Recovering,
  which is elided here; see the top-level
  diagram.
end note

note bottom of Linking
  Subscribed means the transport is usable
  and notifications are confirmed enabled.
  No L3 traffic is permitted before it,
  which is what makes hazard H-11
  unreachable rather than merely avoided.
end note

@enduml
